Z||000000||Rob S||07-20-2000||10:27 AM||||Just a reminder that Midwest Fieros car club is putting on it's 2nd annual all Fiero Car show this Saturday in conjunction with the Monona County fair in Onawa, Iowa. Last year we had over 40 Fieros entered and are expecting more this year. For more information see our web page: <BR> <A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/midwestfieros/" TARGET=_blank>http://www.geocities.com/midwestfieros/</A>  <P>Rob Swanson<BR>Midwest Fieros<BR>Pierre SD||||reg||1
Z||000001||batboy||07-20-2000||11:12 AM||||I've been driving the Batmobile everyday for the last several weeks, so it's trashed and I have no time to clean it up, but I'm tempted to make the 4 hour road trip up to Onawa just to look at everyone else's rides and get some ideas, plus maybe take lots of pics.||||reg||1
Z||000002||deceler8||07-20-2000||07:08 PM||||I'll be there for the swapmeet, and sure as heck won't miss our entry in the Demolition Derby...<P>Bring an umbrella...the plastic will be flying !||||reg||1
Z||000003||2birds||07-21-2000||01:36 AM||||I envy you guys.  Iowa (Cedar Rapids/Marion) is my real home.  I was just there two weeks ago, and I enjoyed every minute of it.  Ahh, the sweet smell of a feed lot...smells better than the inside of a submarine!||||reg||1
Z||000004||sluppy123||07-21-2000||05:27 PM||||I'm in the process of getting ready as we speak. I can't wait to see how many Fieros we get. The Demo derby should be sweet. <P>If any of you guys see a Silver 87' GT with Side scoops and Brand new Mr Mikes leather seats or a stock Red 87' GT, That's me.<P><P>------------------<BR>-Brian||||reg||10
Z||000005||Rob S||07-24-2000||04:27 PM||||We had a fantastic show in Onawa, 53 Fieros were entered, great weather, a great time was had by all... hope to see you there next year.<P>Rob Swanson<BR>Pierre Sd<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000006||sluppy123||07-24-2000||05:51 PM||||It was a awesome show, Great people and some very nice cars. I even won a Trophy, 1st place in the Custom GT Class  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">. Can't wait till next year.<P>-Brian S.<BR>Lincoln, NE<BR>85' SC & 87' GT<P><BR><p>[This message has been edited by sluppy123 (edited 07-24-2000).]||||reg||10
